# Environment / secrets
.env

# generated catalog sinks (regenerated weekly by nosignups-catalog-sync DAG)
# NOTE: uses /* not / so the hand-curated ssg/ subdir can be re-included below.
# Git cannot negate a path whose parent DIRECTORY is excluded by a trailing-slash
# pattern, so `data/tool-directories/` + `!.../ssg/` would silently fail.
data/tool-directories/*
data/tool_catalog.json

# hand-curated (NOT regenerated) — must stay tracked
!data/tool-directories/ssg/
